Comment: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:21.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:28.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:36.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Gaw formation from North America,\Nled by Captain Char...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:40.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...carried out a surprise attack against\Nthe Earth Federation Headquarters at Jaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, with the efforts of\Nthe Gundam and others...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the Federation Forces fought back hard\Nand the enemy was forced to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:55.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But will Char really give up so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.05,0:02:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Point B-3! Thus far, we have\Nnothing out of the ordinary to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just regular Zeon bombings, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.67,0:02:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:35.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the point in regular reports\Nfrom a remote outpost like ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:37.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't complain so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:40.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys aren't doing their patrols\Njust to earn a paycheck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:19.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another regular bombing, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:22.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's nothing to be concerned about.\NNow then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:26.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base's crew organization\Nwill remain as it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:29.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll be assigned to the\N13th Autonomous Corps of the Tianem fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will now announce each of your ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:36.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Junior Grade Bright Noa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:37.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.11,0:03:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ensign Mirai Yashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:42.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Petty Officer Sayla Mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:45.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:49.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before we've even thought about It,{\i}\N{\i1}we've been made into soldiers.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:50.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief Petty Officer Amuro Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:54.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Corporal Kai Shiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:55.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Corporal Hayato Kobayashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:58.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't received anything like this{\i}\N{\i1}since my grade school diploma.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What good will this do?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Private 1st Class Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:10.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Private 1st Class Fraw Bow? Isn't she here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.47,0:04:12.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Nooo!\N- We don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:14.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come back here, you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no. Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way! I'm not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:21.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way are we leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.49,0:04:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, the children absolutely refuse\Nto go to the childcare center, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How self-centered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:35.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have some expertise in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll convince those children.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:39.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, you should come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:40.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:42.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and receive your appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.63,0:04:43.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:50.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu Jose has been promoted two ranks\Nfor honorable death in the line of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's been appointed lieutenant junior grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.23,0:04:56.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All other casualties have also\Nbeen promoted two ranks. That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Promoted two ranks?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Promoted two ranks... ?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:15.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Promoted two ranks... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:19.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is... Is that all they get?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:20.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:24.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They get promoted two ranks, and that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the end of the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:28.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? What exactly are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:31.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do nothing for us while we're fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:33.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and afterwards you hand out ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:36.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you at least say "thank you"\Nto Mr. Ryu and the others?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:38.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.99,0:05:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who said you could dodge my blow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:46.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do that again and I'll put you in solitary!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:48.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:50.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you do say things that you shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An occasional smack is good medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:56.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I get the message. Let's just drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what about Kikka and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.26,0:06:02.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were told the facility has\Nlots of fun playgrounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So they went with the childcare officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:08.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:11.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think those kids will\Nreally be happy if they stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:16.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think they'll be fine wherever they end up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:20.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got no choice.\NThey've gotta stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:21.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:26.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Little children shouldn't have to see\Npeople killing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:30.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:01.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The preparations are done, Captain Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:02.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:20.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Juice! Juice! Delicious juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:22.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want soft-serve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:24.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are so innocent and carefree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:26.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:29.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with kids being carefree?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:31.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But all that does is make adults happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are one cynical kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:37.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you stick around here long enough,\Nyou'll all end up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:44.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a war going on right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:50.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I do is sit around waiting until\Nmy mother and father come and see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:54.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mommy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.91,0:07:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.54,0:07:58.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aw, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:00.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:01.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw! I wanna go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:08.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna go back to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:11.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look what you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Me too...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna go home. I wanna go...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:21.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:22.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Now, Kikka. Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:26.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:30.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come back here!\NKatz! Letz! Kikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:32.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:43.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come back, you kids! Can't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:47.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please answer me, Kikka dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:49.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Katz! Letz!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:10.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:12.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait. They're kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:17.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:20.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's slippery, Katz. So be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:33.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Katz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:35.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They sure gave me a scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Char?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:47.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation's come a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:51.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is probably just a small sample\Nof what they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:54.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we doing it now? Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course...\NRamuji. Have your team set them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:09:58.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akahana, our teams will head\Nto the Trojan Horse's dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ha! This'll be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep running! If they catch us,\Nthey'll take us back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:13.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't run anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:14.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kikka! Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if we have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:18.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey. This door opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:22.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It does? Okay, Kikka.\NWe'll rest here for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we'll go back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How much longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir, five more minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.15,0:10:33.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:33.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:36.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there nobody here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:38.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look, Gundam's!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:41.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So many!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's kinda different from Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:48.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, they're a lot different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! Something's near its feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:54.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Near its feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:56.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw something move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.64,0:10:57.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:01.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You imagined it. I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something really moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:07.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It could've been a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:10.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- What?! A person?! Then we're in trouble.\N- L-Let's hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:11.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:18.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Run away! Run away!\N- The other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel\Nbut it'll make it tougher, Fraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:25.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'd just like to see them once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if it's just from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:28.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:29.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the childcare officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm glad I found you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kikka and the others have all run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't think ill of us, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.22,0:11:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've set them to detonate in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:41.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:04.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're b-b-bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.\NWe're finally authorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.86,0:12:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's terrific! Now we can go on the tour!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're coming too, right, Mr. Kai?\NTo the Gundam factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:40.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, sure. I'll go to take my mind off things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:44.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Bright.\NReport to the operations room at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the military for you.\NYou guys go ahead without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:51.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:53.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll enjoy it more without your superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it! Katz, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:13:01.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-We gotta get rid of those bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:01.22,Dialogue,,0,0,980,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:06.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Katz! Kikka! You two look under here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.93,0:13:08.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:11.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well? Any bombs??
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.69,0:13:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Did you find any?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No good! At this rate,\Nwe'll blow up along with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:20.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna! What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:21.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.57,0:13:24.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This one's a bomb, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:26.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-There's one over here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:27.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kikka, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:07.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on! Start, engine! Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm trying, but this thing won't start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:14.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But are you sure you know\Nhow to make it move?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:16.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll manage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it! It started!\NOkay, next I need to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.97,0:14:25.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. That wasn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those voices were Katz and Letz!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are they doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:47.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We gotta go after them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:48.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop the car, Katz! Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:55.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:15:00.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zeon set some bombs!\NWe're throwing them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.59,0:15:01.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bombs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:06.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-This is... Amuro, looks like it's true.\NThese are time bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you find them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:10.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inside the Gundam factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, Letz. Get in the other car\Nand leave the rest to me. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:18.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai! Help the kids into the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:21.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me.\NOkay, Letz! You go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:21.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- C'mon!\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:23.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.03,0:15:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, don't be scared. On three...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.99,0:15:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See, I told you it was fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:30.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay! You're next, Kikka. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:33.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:36.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You all did good. All yours, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:39.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:14.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We did it! Yay! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.71,0:16:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoever set these bombs\Nwill likely attack the White Base too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Ramuji's team went all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:32.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ivanov. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:34.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, Captain Char.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our mission has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:37.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Distract the enemy with the Acguys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.77,0:16:38.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Understood, sir.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's starting to look rough up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's attacking with mobile suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.22,0:17:11.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Katz!? Kikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Letz!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Katz! Letz! Please answer me!\N- Kikka! Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:20.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Katz! Letz! Kikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:26.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Artesia
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:33.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:54.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I never would have thought you'd join Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:56.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not my gentle brother Casval!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:18:00.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you leave the military for me, Artesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:02.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla! Are you there?\NPlease answer me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:05.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:05.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Casval!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:10.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:14.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you?! Kikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:15.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:16.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.07,0:18:18.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard gunfire... Was there a Zeon soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was there a...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:23.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was a Zeon officer here on this rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.92,0:18:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't notice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.67,0:18:26.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe we shouldn't go that way, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Char...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ignore them. We're all leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our mission is a failure,\Nso we're withdrawing. Got that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:18:57.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:08.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.35,0:19:27.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!\NFour or five mobile suits... that's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:33.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Char...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.61,0:19:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain! lvanov's Acguy\Nhas been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:41.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:44.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you stop, you won't survive!\NKeep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:54.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:05.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.52,0:20:07.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's still coming?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:11.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though they're Acguys,\Nhe took out four of them all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's improved his skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An underground water vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:47.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, I can't see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:02.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Knowing Char, he must have\Nused that opportunity to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.30,0:21:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:22.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, they're guaranteed to be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:25.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, the children are the future\Nof the Federation Forces...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:27.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...so they're brought up with great care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:30.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even after what happened today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, when I consider their feelings,\NI'm not sure these kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.07,0:21:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you called them the future\Nof the Federation Forces, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.03,0:21:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...They might see a world without Zeon\Nor Federation Forces within their lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.16,0:21:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you consider that possibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:52.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our little rascals here\Naren't your average children.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.33,0:21:54.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In all this time\Nthey've seen plenty of gunfire...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:57.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and they've been fighting with us\Nthrough those battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.80,0:22:02.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've seen some terrible things\Neven an adult like you couldn't imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:05.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And they never turned away their eyes.\NYou understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:07.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't wanna leave us. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.76,0:22:08.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.43,0:22:10.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... but they...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:20.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I suppose you may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.53,0:22:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll make all the necessary arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:26.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Then... then... It's so wonderful!\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.91,0:22:32.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.75,0:22:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we can keep on bickering!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.00,0:22:36.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.54,0:22:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile, due to Char's guerrilla attack,\Nthe Earth Federation Forces...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.01,0:22:46.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...have decided to speed up their space campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The admirals have figured out...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:52.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...that Zeon has a high opinion\Nof the White Base's abilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.73,0:22:56.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and so it would make an ideal decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.44,0:23:04.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that the 13th Autonomous Corps...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...will specialize in decoy operations?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.79,0:23:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The White Base takes off into space...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...where an immense battlefield awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.55,0:23:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Char's relentless pursuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:28.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...eventually leads to fleet combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:32.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will the approaching giant tear\Nthe mobile suit to pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NA Decoy in Space.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:39.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
